From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 06:23:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: let schedutil reach
 the top P-cluster states

t8132.dtsi marks the P cluster's 4416 and 4464 MHz states turbo-mode, so
they are boost frequencies: the policy is created with cpuinfo.max_freq =
4104 MHz, arch_topology takes that as capacity_freq_ref, and schedutil,
which caps a CPU's performance at its capacity, never asks for more than
4104 MHz. Only the performance governor reaches 4464 MHz.

macOS's Automatic mode runs one thread at the top state. On the J604
(macOS 27.2 26B123 and Linux 1.877, same rowsbench build, AC):

  macOS Automatic, 1 thread       725.1 Mmix/s
  Linux performance, CPU 0        725.0 Mmix/s
  Linux balanced (schedutil), CPU 0  667.3 Mmix/s = 92 %, the 4104/4464 ratio

Drop turbo-mode from both states on the J604, so they are ordinary
states, the reference frequency is 4464 MHz and schedutil reaches them
under full load. The performance governor already asks every P core for
4464 MHz; the SoC grants the top state only as its limits allow, as
before. Other T8132 Macs are not measured, so t8132.dtsi stays as it is.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index 41436dd258..0549485d29 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -418,3 +418,18 @@ &atcphy0 {
 &atcphy1 {
 	apple,dp-alt-mode;
 };
+
+/*
+ * The P cluster's 4416 and 4464 MHz states as ordinary states, not boost:
+ * macOS's Automatic mode runs one thread at the top state, and schedutil
+ * reaches a state only up to the policy's non-boost maximum.
+ */
+&donan_p_opp {
+	opp-4416000000 {
+		/delete-property/ turbo-mode;
+	};
+
+	opp-4464000000 {
+		/delete-property/ turbo-mode;
+	};
+};
-- 
